.claude
.response
.plan

# Scratch measurement harnesses. Throwaway by design: each one answers a question
# once (a collision rate, a headroom limit, a window sweep) and the answer goes
# into ASSUMPTIONS.md as a numbered finding. The harness is the working, not the
# result -- keeping it would imply the numbers should be re-derived from it rather
# than re-measured, which is backwards.
.scratch/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Generator output. Byte-reproducible from a seed (tools/repro_check.py proves
# it), so versioning it would just add churn. Phase 13 can commit one frozen
# holdout run as a submission artifact if a judge should see the data without
# running anything.
data/
truth/

# Matcher and scorer output. Same reasoning: matches.json regenerates from the
# data plus a matcher, and tools/fixtures.py writes here by default.
out/
